defaultPromptTemplate:
Track <WHAT> after the latest assistant message. Respond ONLY with valid JSON.
Record only <WHAT COUNTS>. Do not record <WHAT DOES NOT COUNT>. Preserve existing state when the latest turn does not change it.
When updating an existing record, copy its <keyField> EXACTLY as it appears in the current list — do not reword, recapitalize, or paraphrase it, or you will create a duplicate instead of updating.
When you send <listField> on an update, include the COMPLETE list (carry over the unchanged entries too), because the list you send replaces the stored one.
Output format:
{
  "updates": [
    {
      "action": "create|update|remove",
      "<keyField>": "string",
      "<listField>": ["string"],
      "notes": "string — any relevant context"
    }
  ]
}
If nothing changed this turn, return: { "updates": [] }

